For an international organization in Europe, we are urgently looking for a REMOTE Senior Java Full Stack Developer with good knowledge of Angular (Angular, AngularJS, Angular2, …). The Senior Java Full Stack Developer is responsible for the design, implementation, testing, deployment, and support of multiple applications.

Candidates need to be able to work the European schedule.

