• Participate in architecture and design work for improvements to existing and/or implementation of new applications;

• Implement required functionality, which includes code for frontend, backend, database, cloud deployment, tests, etc;

• Test applications;

• Participate in release activities through various environments;

• Provide support for deployed applications, incident analysis, and resolution;

• The document agreed solutions, requirements, test cases, release notes;

• Perform other related duties as required;

Profile:

• Bachelor or Master degree;

• Fluent in English;

• +5/+10 years of Java software development experience;

• Hands-on experience with Spring Boot, JPA, EJB, JSF, JUnit;

• Hands-on experience with Angular, Web Components;

• Significant experience in design and document data models, Java code, User Experience and User Interface, test cases, release notes, etc;

Hands-on experience in the following technical areas is an advantage:

• UX/UI, HTML5, CSS3, Javascript;

• Core AWS services, Cloud Formation, monitoring, and alerts in the cloud;

• SOLR, Elastic Search;

• Selenium, Cucumber or similar;

